{
  "_": [
    "docs/design/FLOOR.md § 4.6 — THE ONE STATEMENT of how a layout and the installs the fleet",
    "reports compose into floors. Two runtimes implement it — App\\Building\\Building::compose()",
    "for the admin console and public/js/lobby/lobby-model.js floors() for the lobby — and both",
    "are held to every case here (Tests\\Feature\\Building, Tests\\Feature\\Lobby). A case is the",
    "RAW authored document (a list of room sets), the installs the fleet reports, and the floors",
    "that must come out: floor keys ascending, rooms by install ascending, `reported` per room.",
    "Add a case here and both suites gain it; a rule that lives in one runtime and not the other",
    "is what this file exists to red."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "the empty layout is today's building: one floor per install, open",
      "layout": [],
      "installs": ["sola", "aimla"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "aimla", "rooms": [{"install": "aimla", "form": "open", "reported": true}]},
        {"floor": "sola", "rooms": [{"install": "sola", "form": "open", "reported": true}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the operator's hallway: two solo installs composed onto one floor, keyed by the least room",
      "layout": [{"zeta": "office", "sola": "office"}],
      "installs": ["zeta", "sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the operator's mixed floor: one open PM+impl room and two offices on one floor",
      "layout": [{"sola": "office", "aimla": "open", "zeta": "office"}],
      "installs": ["aimla", "sola", "zeta"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "aimla", "rooms": [
          {"install": "aimla", "form": "open", "reported": true},
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two PM+impl rooms on one floor, and a second floor of offices",
      "layout": [{"mira": "open", "nova": "open"}, {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}],
      "installs": ["nova", "mira", "zeta", "sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "mira", "rooms": [
          {"install": "mira", "form": "open", "reported": true},
          {"install": "nova", "form": "open", "reported": true}
        ]},
        {"floor": "sola", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an install the layout does not place gets a floor of its own, open, and sorts among the composed ones",
      "layout": [{"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}],
      "installs": ["sola", "zeta", "aimla"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "aimla", "rooms": [{"install": "aimla", "form": "open", "reported": true}]},
        {"floor": "sola", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a room the fleet reports nothing for is drawn on its floor and flagged, never omitted",
      "layout": [{"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}],
      "installs": ["sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": false}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a floor none of whose rooms report is still a floor",
      "layout": [{"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}],
      "installs": [],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": false},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": false}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a one-room floor is worth authoring only for its form",
      "layout": [{"sola": "office"}],
      "installs": ["sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "rooms": [{"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an all-digit install id survives the integer-key cast in both runtimes",
      "layout": [{"42": "open", "7": "open"}],
      "installs": ["42", "7"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "42", "rooms": [
          {"install": "42", "form": "open", "reported": true},
          {"install": "7", "form": "open", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
